Cell["\<\
\"new\"  ones  uses orbit representatives and angles sometimes chosen \
differently to make it \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]better represent\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] SL(2,Z) orbits, so it doesn\[CloseCurlyQuote]t \
literally agree with Jan\[CloseCurlyQuote]s\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"17f93e0a-d6d5-4b49-a5dd-12dd24e534ef"],

